# Nick Fury, Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D.: "Power-up - {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Put two +1/+1 counters on Nick Fury, then look at the top seven cards
# of your library. You may put a Hero, Equipment, or Vehicle card from among them onto the battlefield. If it's a double-faced card,
# you may transform it. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order." On turn 1, the turn he enters, the cost is
# reduced by his mana cost {W}: it takes {U}{B}{R}{G} and nothing more (the pool is empty after). The top seven cards are an
# Ornithopter (an artifact creature, not Equipment: refused), four Plains, a Gold Pan (Equipment) and, seventh, Monica Rambeau (a
# double-faced Hero); the eighth, a Masked Meower (a Hero), is not looked at (refused). Two cards at once are refused ("up to one").
# Bot1 puts Monica onto the battlefield untapped and transforms her into Photon; Nick Fury has two counters, a 4/3; the other six
# cards looked at go to the bottom of the library, which holds 17 cards in all.

